    "Build or script prompt sets with deliberate phonetic, accent and demographic coverage targets so the collected corpus isn't skewed toward a single dialect or demographic.",
    "Capture audio through a dedicated recording app or kiosk that logs consent-form acceptance, participant ID and recording metadata (device, sample rate, environment) alongside the waveform.",
    "Run collected audio through a transcription QA pass (human double-check or Whisper-style pseudo-labeling followed by human correction) to produce aligned text-audio pairs.",
    "Use a forced-aligner (Montreal Forced Aligner or similar) to produce word/phoneme-level timestamp alignment needed for ASR training.",
